  "version": "0.7.6",
  "notes": "### Added\n- A Sync button next to New on Today, and a small Sync button beside the Sync status in the sidebar, so you can sync without opening Settings.\n- Task spacing in Settings > Appearance: Comfortable or Compact. Compact fits about twice as many tasks on screen. It applies to this device.\n\n### Changed\n- Today uses the full width of large windows. Your tasks get the room, and the schedule keeps a fixed column on the right.\n- A task's description shows as one line in your lists. Links to notes show as chips that open the note, long links are shortened, and the full text stays in the task.\n- Tasks inside an area group no longer repeat the area on every row.\n\n### Fixed\n- The task menu (⋮) is a clean list again, with every label fully visible.",
